ing\nOperator\n.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":40,"base":{"hp":742,"atk":157,"def":130,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":9,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1060,"atk":235,"def":187,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":9,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":55,"base":{"hp":1060,"atk":235,"def":187,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":11,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1325,"atk":325,"def":260,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":11,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"1-1"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":0,"def":50}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests have shown the outlines of her internal organs to be indistinct due to abnormal shadows. Originium granules have been detected in her circulatory system, confirming her to be infected with Oripathy.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 7.4%\nShe presents no obvious external symptoms of Oripathy.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.2 u/L\nDegree of infection is minor and physical symptoms are not yet present."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Fang shows off a Kuranta's natural dominance in battle by always holding the most advantageous position at the critical moment. To strike a balance between power and control, Fang prefers to use a spear, which she applies with versatility in any situation. Fang acts impulsively and springs into action before others even finish talking."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Immigrants from many nations came to the outskirts of Columbia. Fang, Kroos, and Beagle all met there after moving from their respective homelands. After realizing their common goals, they joined the city guard and underwent basic training together. The humorless Fang, the gentle Beagle, and the laid-back Kroos possess wildly different personalities yet rely on one another for support."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Before an election day, a Catastrophe struck the outskirts of Columbia. In their efforts to aid others in escaping, all three Operators were infected with Oripathy. Fang suffered discrimination due to her condition and fell into deep despair. Kroos rallied the three of them and together they went to Rhodes Island."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"After arriving at Rhodes Island, Fang and her two companions as well as Hibiscus and Lava were all trained by Dobermann. The training was extraordinarily intense, and Kroos and Hibiscus seized every opportunity they could to goof off. Even Fang as their captain couldn't do anything to control them. Currently, Fang is training herself to be as intense and strict as her teacher, Dobermann. However, if the giddy expression on her face as she eats fruit is any indication, she's got a long way to go."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Fang%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Fang%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Cruciata","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Fang%20-%20Cruciata.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Fang%20-%20Cruciata.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit - Esperanta","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Kal'tsit%20-%20Esperanta%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When other allies e